<title>USA: News Corp to contest EchoStar claim.</title>
<headline>News Corp to contest EchoStar claim.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp Ltd said on Friday that it would &quot;vigorously contest&quot; a move by EchoStar Communications Corp  to obtain a declaratory judgment that News Corp is obliged to lend EchoStar $200 million.</p>
<p>Earlier on Friday, EchoStar said it filed for the judgment in U.S. Federal District Court in Colorado.</p>
<p>News Corp said in a statement that there was no merit to EchoStar's claim.</p>
<p>Asked if this legal dispute meant the two companies' plan to create a direct-TV satellite system was now dead, a News Corp spokesman said the company had no comment on that matter.</p>
</text>
